==Strategy==
==='''Chapter 1'''===
Don't spawn anything at first and wait for your money to get a bit higher. When the [[Pigge]] gets close to your base, try and stall her while you save up enough money to spawn [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]]. Keep spawning meatshields. Bahamut will take care of most things in the level, and kill [[Imperator Sael]] in 2 - 3 hits based on his level and your [[Treasure]]s.

==='''Chapter 2'''===
If one has units that can Knockback or Perma-Freeze Aliens, such as [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Castaway Cat]] or the uber, [[Hayabusa (Uber Rare Cat)|Oni Hayabusa]], use them.

==='''Chapter 3'''===
Units that can tank or outrange Alpacky such as [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Jamiera Cat]] or [[Nerd Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Hacker Cat]] respectively are invaluable if not mandatory. Treat this like a normal Camelle, but make sure to save your Cat Cannon for when she gets to 1% HP. With a little luck, one may be able to freeze Alpacky outright by stacking [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Seafarer Cat]] on the Cyberhorn.

