==Trivia==
*In the Taiwanese version, this stage takes place in '''Turkey'''; [[Turkey (Into the Future)|stage 15]] is Greece and Dubai is moved to [[India (Into the Future)|stage 17]].
*Along with [[Moon (Empire of Cats)|Iriomote Island]] ([[Empire of Cats]] stage 48 in [[Nyanko Daisensou|BCJP]]), it is the only stage to change [[backgrounds]] between chapters: in Chapters 1 and 2 it takes place in a ruined city like [[China (Into the Future)|China]], while in Chapter 3 it becomes a wintry snowscape.

